{"kind":"grammar","lang":"en","entities":{"n3-053":{"renderings":[{"id":"9407e8d37ae53ca8","role":"prose","field":"shortExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n3-053"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Express a wish or hope; 'it would be nice if', 'I hope that'."},{"id":"3d5f044e6867d1ba","role":"prose","field":"longExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n3-053"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"The ～といいなあ grammar point is used to express a wish or hope for something to happen or to be in a certain way. It can be translated as 'it would be nice if' or 'I hope that' in English. The formation differs depending on whether it is used with a verb, い-adjective, な-adjective, or noun."},{"id":"dd6673d549f951c5","role":"prose","field":"formation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n3-053"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Verb-casual + といいなあ, い-Adjective + といいなあ, な-Adjective + だといいなあ, Noun + だといいなあ"},{"id":"78b9290e8fffa6d7","role":"prose","field":"usageNote","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n3-053"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"といいなあ: 'I hope', a hope for something you can't control (晴れるといいなあ)."},{"id":"d6e1d43571c480f1","role":"label","field":"family","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"wish"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Wish And Hope (I Hope / If Only)","of":{"kind":"family","id":"wish"}}]},"n3-053#4ef319b71096":{"renderings":[{"id":"8cf01fd67f9ff9c1","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n3-053"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"I hope it's sunny tomorrow."}]},"n3-053#f2ed82e77196":{"renderings":[{"id":"cf314ad493840542","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n3-053"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"I hope I pass this exam."}]},"n3-053#1950c8645e97":{"renderings":[{"id":"fb09018fa5e73885","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n3-053"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"I hope she is doing well."}]},"n3-053#03ce78f2dd79":{"renderings":[{"id":"0693a2540073b5f6","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n3-053"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"I hope he finds a new job."}]}}}